1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,862
Augur turns observable creature behavior into deterministic
Omens, and onchain prediction markets.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,482
The Chamber shows replay footage alongside published market
data.

3
00:00:12,682 --> 00:00:17,942
Deterministic observation rules map behavior to BUY, HOLD, or
SELL.

4
00:00:18,142 --> 00:00:21,601
Participants back the next Omen before the market locks.

5
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,716
Privy handles wallet authentication and signing.

6
00:00:27,916 --> 00:00:30,087
Monad Testnet handles settlement.

7
00:00:30,287 --> 00:00:36,464
Here, practice credits demonstrate position selection without
submitting another blockchain transaction.

8
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:42,076
Deterministic rules, not AI, produce the signal.

9
00:00:42,276 --> 00:00:48,301
Indexed commitments are inspectable, even where the full
offchain provenance manifest is unavailable.

10
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:56,051
Envio indexes Omens, predictions, resolutions, and claims.

11
00:00:56,251 --> 00:00:58,457
Alchemy powers Monad RPC.

12
00:00:58,657 --> 00:01:02,256
These are actual testnet records, not mainnet trading.

13
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:05,699
Replay Chambers show different creatures.

14
00:01:05,899 --> 00:01:11,095
Chainlink CRE validates publication requests in authenticated
simulation.

15
00:01:11,295 --> 00:01:13,300
Deployment access remains pending.

16
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:17,159
Physical behavior becomes a verifiable signal.

17
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:19,065
The signal becomes a market.

18
00:01:19,265 --> 00:01:20,322
This is Augur.
